      "sourceHash": "d4f2745363d19f5dedf332ce7bd81acdcc5f51f11779b9cd95c5e15d829c2ad8",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-3"
      ],
      "text": "支持 通过与其他使用元气心情主题的设备碰一碰，即可互相解锁隐藏款表情",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-02",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 4,
      "sourceHash": "25c2d53ffa463e838006e763d7189310957aaab8963dd24a33c44eb9242df4ec",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-4"
      ],
      "text": "使用“精致毛球的一天”主题，在锁屏界面点击小艺星环图标后，通过语音或输入口令可触发有趣好玩的交互动画; 使用“毛球对对磁”主题，通过与其他使用该主题的设备碰一碰可互相解锁趣味动画 (主题应用升级至 1\\.0\\.23 及以上版本，打开主题应用 > 搜索相应主题)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-04",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 5,
      "sourceHash": "102680a7b4ab687466d3f1a9ffb7175aefbe8f54701cd1bb58e8bfbf082ece7d",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-5"
      ],
      "text": "在锁屏界面点击“GAME”按钮可进入“石头剪刀布”游戏画面，通过与人机猜拳可赢取随机套装装扮小胖手; 与其他使用“小胖手”主题的设备碰一碰，还可互相解锁趣味动画 (主题应用升级至 1\\.0\\.23 及以上版本，打开主题应用 > 搜索“小胖手”)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-03",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 6,
      "sourceHash": "2398472a955b865ad47341e842eb073f9756c84ee508b27a177e28ecd4f0d83a",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-6"
      ],
      "text": "在部分应用场景下，支持与搭载 HarmonyOS 5 及以上的手机一碰多分享，多人分享、组队互动更畅快; 还支持与搭载 HarmonyOS 6 的鸿蒙电脑碰一碰分享，实现文档、图片双向传递等更多场景，带来更高效的办公体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-04",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 7,
      "sourceHash": "7e2c4d2be024757c6dbd4847607f4426c77845fa7b08b68df5d04cd5d1255a69",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-7"
      ],
      "text": "在键鼠共享状态下，只需按下 Ctrl 键并注视目标设备，即可切换键鼠操作至目标设备; 当拖动文档、图片等素材时，只需注视目标设备并按下 Ctrl 键，素材即可瞬移到目标设备，松手直接落入，简单高效 (部分应用支持)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-05",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 8,
      "sourceHash": "dbff6b6017a80132fe53ab5a6fd52e5c427e2f950a15260e1621089da80cc824",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-8"
      ],
      "text": "可通过点、按、滑、拖、敲、圈、抓、碰、捏等常用手势与多种便捷操作，玩转更多元、高效、便捷的交互体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-06",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 9,
      "sourceHash": "7b36be6369e00758612c219cb1794413d92c5370c8ae91c7c0d10c57417b1b11",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-9"
      ],
      "text": "您可精细化管控设备使用时长，为孩子发放奖励积分用于兑换用机时长，守护儿童健康用机 (孩子设备也需要支持该功能)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-05",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 10,
      "sourceHash": "598b6b38079106f82bfbda3f0fe310e0a61b1ca64d072832b48002f2cbd18712",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-10"
      ],
      "text": "1\\. 小艺帮帮忙，只需一句话指令，即可让小艺帮您打开应用并完成一系列复杂、连贯的任务，同时上划任务界面还能变成导航条在后台处理。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-07",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 11,
      "sourceHash": "cc2ef196f8a3a21fc87dada46f823388abfafe10375bfa59f8df63850b875edb",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-11"
      ],
      "text": "2\\. 新增小艺任务，可以帮您解决日常生活中周期性任务，或定时定点触发类任务，提升生活效率，跟小艺说“当…时，就执行…”即可创建单次或循环任务，比如“当我快到家时，播报语音提醒我取快递”。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-06",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 12,
      "sourceHash": "cacbc72d28346b89d439d1312faf6dcb749269d2ccf4bd5aa8af24b0f569c903",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-12"
      ],
      "text": "3\\. “方言自由说”全新升级，在支持方言识别基础上，新增七种方言播报 (粤语、四川话、陕西话、天津话、长沙话、上海话、闽南话)，小艺既能听懂方言，还可用相应的方言来跟您交流。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-08",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 13,
      "sourceHash": "94d7a33c2e3471601236676a5befc51bd8b3286098911c12874597e871de8ca8",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-13"
      ],
      "text": "4\\. 小艺看世界，在小艺应用主对话界面点击右下角的通话按钮进入真人感小艺，可开启实时语音对话，也可以再次点击摄像头按钮开启实时视频对话，实现边看边聊边思考，小艺可调用天气、日历、位置等系统服务数据和工具，在穿搭建议、景点介绍、百科问答、饮食建议等多种场景，像亲密的朋友一样陪您一起探索世界。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-07",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 14,
      "sourceHash": "599c986a75a7f22be485145bebeed7107c699fea4d9dfdbbf63162d1eb898cd8",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-14"
      ],
      "text": "1\\. AI 一键成片可选择多张图片智能搭配运镜、音乐生成视频，支持为合适的静态照片生成动态效果，将照片盘活成鲜活回忆。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-08",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 15,
      "sourceHash": "90d986f7362fda3844f8d660c08b18acb0817942a2c8fb6001386297b4e5880c",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-15"
      ],
      "text": "2\\. AI 反光消除，编辑照片时，可一键消除照片上的反光，让照片更清晰 (图库编辑 > AI 修图 > 反光)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-09",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 16,
      "sourceHash": "f3cf1d562b6b71bbaf50427bfe1e266d5d4f84bdfa8565594598c81d6298524a",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-16"
      ],
      "text": "在备忘录工具栏中点击帮写图标，即可开启 AI 帮写助手，您可以使用多种模板，还能通过指令进行内容续写、文风改写等。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-09",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 17,
      "sourceHash": "02d7e6ad848c13c0a2386bcbd60394eff0950c1e6cb62f42b08316812df57682",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-17"
      ],
      "text": "1\\. 与陌生人通话时，可智能对通话信息进行涉诈检测，识别诈骗套路并及时提醒。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-10",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 18,
      "sourceHash": "6746b244318f427f062b2b274d1114f41a4b0c0ffc48657855feae5ebd69f119",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-18"
      ],
      "text": "2\\. 当视频通话时，可智能识别对方是否为 AI 换脸并提醒，助您规避风险。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-11",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 19,
      "sourceHash": "d9c343980f2f8d3f9cff8b0728b8ed150920b265de054b8a0bb218294632c790",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-19"
      ],
      "text": "当家人接到诈骗电话时，系统会提醒您关注，您也能帮家人远程挂断风险电话，防御诈骗的发生。您标记的高风险电话会自动加入家庭黑名单，帮助家人一起拦截风险，守护家人用机安全。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-12",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 20,
      "sourceHash": "92229933f948893496b86dbe44aaf82f8f5f27bb4c1ce44232ebdb76131cd690",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-20"
      ],
      "text": "可对应用设置防窥保护，当使用这些应用时，如果手机检测到身边可能有他人窥视的风险，会提醒您留意屏幕隐私 (设置 > 隐私和安全 > 防窥保护)。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-13",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 21,
      "sourceHash": "4c43711903ceef420fd9449da24a9229f3a9ced59d03ef6341906745160cc971",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-21"
      ],
      "text": "支持对文件、图片、视频设置加密分享，授权指定用户访问，带来超安心的分享体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-14",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 22,
      "sourceHash": "470fbf3cb4eacafc426b32075e1fdcea97c4c626b0270ab35602eb0866072e82",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-22"
      ],
      "text": "个人智能计算平台 HPIC，保障 AI 上云数据不存储、不泄露、不滥用，让云侧 AI 的数据处理和端侧一样安全，为您的数据隐私保驾护航。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-15",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 23,
      "sourceHash": "d0870462a6870b890de7f2769e3312dd7863f5e8d006bc0fe065f4bb7ca57420",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-23"
      ],
      "text": "整机性能和续航更进一步，操作更丝滑，续航更持久。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-16",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 24,
      "sourceHash": "e15a69cc85bf850e855a4bb784210a1c9004be8ce1494d772aa3cec4cd3ffc4f",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-24"
      ],
      "text": "1\\. 带来应用秒启、页面秒开、内容秒加载的超流畅体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-17",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 25,
      "sourceHash": "4bd374597a8fd85c5204c2861035037e999962a68d9cd370aa4ba93ca1273b7f",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-25"
      ],
      "text": "2\\. 应用安装更快速，扫码体验更便捷，边视频边购物等分屏操作更加流畅稳定。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-18",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "HarmonyOS_6_更新说明.md",
      "sourceIndex": 26,
      "sourceHash": "a473cf2c974f69610731b08656805f8fbf778210ba22aaf8b1d6dbcaf0a33a8b",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-26"
      ],
      "text": "3\\. 华为方舟引擎针对部分头部游戏进行深度优化，流畅游戏体验更持久。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-18"
      ]
    }
  ],
